{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-common-biology-20","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":20,"points":null,"unitId":"genetics","unitLabel":"유전학","topic":"표현형·열성·교배","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["genetics","reproduction"],"stem":"어떤식물에서유전자A, B, C는동일염색체상에존재한다.\n세유전자의열성동형접합체를대상으로교배실험을수행하여\n다음과같은결과를얻었다. [단, A, B, C 유전자의열성동형\n접합체는각각작은키(aa), 노란색잎(bb), 조기개화(cc)의\n표현형을보인다.]\na\na\na\na\nA\nA\nA\nA\nP\n×\n×\nB\nB\nb\nb\nC\nC\nc\nc\na\nA\na\nA\nF1\nC\nc\nB\nb\n자가수분\n자가수분\n정상키\n정상키\n작은키\n정상키\n작은키\n정상키\n작은키\n작은키\nF2\n녹색잎\n녹색잎\n노란색잎\n노란색잎\n정상개화\n정상개화\n조기개화\n조기개화\n개체수\n535\n216\n37\n512\n245\n240\n3\n212\n위실험에관한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. 유전자A는B보다C에더가까이위치한다.\nㄴ. F1 개체의생식세포형성과정에서교차가일어나a와\nb가하나의염색체상에최초로배열되는시기는제1\n감수분열의중기이다.\nㄷ. F2에서작은키와녹색잎을가진개체들의유전자형은\n두종류일수있다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t020","t021","t022","t023","t024","t025","t026","t027","t028","t029","t030","t031","t032","t033","t034","t035","t036","t037","t038","t039","t040","t041","t042","t043","t044","t045","t046","t047","t048","t049","t050","t051","t052","t053","t054","t055","t056","t057","t058","t059","t060","t061","t062","t063","t064","t065","t066","t067","t068","t069"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t070"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t071"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t072"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t073"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t074"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":744,"height":473,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,99.586,297.6,189.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016","t017","t018","t019","t0